# GCSLC Sovereign Gateway — re-align with GitHub/Vercel deployment (mobile live data stream)
# Copy to .env or .env.local and fill; do not commit real values.
# Keep these variable NAMES identical to Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# and to any GitHub Actions / CI secrets so the live data stream stays accessible on mobile.

# Optional: comma-separated IPs for full 8R data (default in code: 127.0.0.1,::1)
# GCSLC_ABUJA_IPS=127.0.0.1,::1

# Optional: base URL of deployed dashboard (S24 Ultra / mobile)
# GCSLC_DASHBOARD_BASE_URL=https://your-vercel-app.vercel.app

# Add any other keys used by your Vercel build or API (same names as in Vercel env).
# Re-align: ensure each name above exists in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# with the same spelling so the S24 Ultra continues to receive live data.
